# Testing a build
@scenario tutorial_lesson_16
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip guide listen]
pip: An exported game must be able to find its own assets.
pip: Export the project. Launch the build outside the project folder and play the sound effects example.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
pip: Which check exercises the files your audience receives?
> Play only from the editor. -> retry
> Run the exported package. -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show pip guide curious]
pip: A packaged run resolves assets through the shipped project. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip guide cheer]
pip: A packaged run resolves assets through the shipped project.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_16]
[flag tutorial_done_16]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_6]
